# NEXUS AI Agency

This project is a production-oriented scaffold for a multi-agent AI agency platform.

## Features
- API-first backend
- Next.js frontend dashboard
- PostgreSQL database integration
- Redis cache support
- Agent definitions via YAML
- Docker Compose orchestration
- Health checks and monitoring hooks

## Local development

```bash
docker compose up --build -d
```

## URLs
- Frontend: http://localhost:3000
- Backend API: http://localhost:8000
- Swagger: http://localhost:8000/docs
- Health: http://localhost:8000/health

## Default environment values

Backend:
```env
APP_NAME=NEXUS AI Agency
APP_ENV=development
APP_PORT=8000
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://nexus_user:nexus_pass@db:5432/nexus
REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0
SECRET_KEY=change-me-strong-secret
OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-key
```

Frontend:
```env
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000
```
